Anthropic's built-in skills
---------------------------
Several skills in user/ were written as alternatives to Anthropic's built-in
skills for Claude (docx, xlsx, pptx, pdf, google-workspace, deep-research,
morning, import-memory, chrome-browser, computer-use) and follow their ideas
and workflows. Anthropic publishes its docx, xlsx, pptx and pdf skills under
the Apache License 2.0.

The motion-graphics skill was written from scratch. Its design was informed by
public documentation of these projects; no code or text was copied from them:
  HyperFrames (heygen-com/hyperframes, Apache-2.0)
  Remotion (remotion-dev/remotion, Remotion licence) and remotion-dev/skills
  iart-ai/motion-skills (MIT)
  echris6/motion-video-kit (MIT)
  adithya-s-k/manim_skill (MIT), Manim Community (MIT)
  digitalsamba/claude-code-video-toolkit (MIT)
  Motion Canvas (MIT)

Font names mentioned in style presets are references only; no font files are
distributed with the user/ skills.
